## Example: Document Management Skill

**Skill Inputs**: `{{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}}`, `{{"{{"}}document_id{{"}}"}}`, `{{"{{"}}table_id{{"}}"}}`
**Skill Outputs**: `{{"{{"}}result{{"}}"}}`

**User Instructions**: "Manage documents - read, create, or update based on request"

```json
{
  "context": "Skill template for document management operations.",
  "analysis": "The skill needs to:\n1. Parse {{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}} to determine action\n2. Use appropriate document tool with {{"{{"}}table_id{{"}}"}}, {{"{{"}}document_id{{"}}"}}\n3. Set {{"{{"}}result{{"}}"}} with confirmation",
  "goal": "Handle document operations based on {{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}}",
  "steps": [
    {
      "description": "Parse request and determine action type",
      "prompt_template": "Analyze the user request: {{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}}\n\nDetermine the action type:\n- If user wants to read/view: action = 'read'\n- If user wants to create/new: action = 'create'\n- If user wants to edit/update: action = 'update'\n\nReturn the determined action.",
      "required_context": ["request"],
      "target_agent": null
    },
    {
      "description": "Execute document operation based on action",
      "prompt_template": "Based on the action determined:\n\n**If reading:**\nCall emery-read-document with:\n- document_id: {{"{{"}}document_id{{"}}"}}\n- table_id: {{"{{"}}table_id{{"}}"}}\n\n**If creating:**\nCall emery-create-document with:\n- table_id: {{"{{"}}table_id{{"}}"}}\n- title: Extract from {{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}}\n\n**If updating:**\nCall emery-update-document with:\n- document_id: {{"{{"}}document_id{{"}}"}}\n- table_id: {{"{{"}}table_id{{"}}"}}\n- content: Changes from {{"{{"}}request{{"}}"}}",
      "required_context": ["request", "document_id", "table_id"],
      "target_agent": null
    },
    {
      "description": "Set result confirmation",
      "prompt_template": "Set the {{"{{"}}result{{"}}"}} output to a confirmation message:\n\nFormat: 'Document [action] successfully: [details]'\n\nInclude:\n- What action was performed\n- Document title or ID affected\n- Any relevant details from the operation",
      "required_context": ["result"],
      "target_agent": null
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## DO:
- Use `{{"{{"}}input_name{{"}}"}}` (double braces) for all dynamic values
- Include actual tool names with variable placeholders in parameters
- Be specific about logic/flow while keeping values abstract
- Include `prompt_template` for EVERY step
- List all variables in `required_context`
- Research to understand available tools and their parameters

## DO NOT:
- Reference specific table names, database names, or organization names
- Hardcode specific table IDs, database IDs, or UUIDs
- Use values that won't exist at runtime
- Assume any particular data structure exists
- Skip `prompt_template` field (required for skill templates)
- Return zero steps (plans must ALWAYS have at least one step)

